# A chat and a new chat switched by the sidebar on a computer (MBUI_WIN=1280x800): the composer goes between their
# places, a new chat left leaves by its own way (up out of view as it fades), what comes in is there at once: no page
# crossfades (docs/motion.md).
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 900
tap 新建对话
wait 900
tap 整理发布清单
wait 900
exit
